# Gitignored files Conductor copies from the repository root into each new
# workspace. Listing anything here replaces Conductor's default `.env*`, so the
# env pattern has to be repeated.
#
# certificates/ holds the self-signed pair `next dev --experimental-https` uses.
# Without it every workspace regenerates its own and macOS asks you to trust a
# new certificate each time.
.env*
certificates/
